{
  "file" : "npc/merchants/dye_maker.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "- Wait a moment! -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "- Currently you're carrying -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "- too many items with you. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "- Please come back later -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "- after you put some items into kafra storage. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Wow..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Such a nice day. Days like this are perfect to make dyes."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Talk"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Make Dyestuffs"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Erm, I don't really have much to say to you. But, if you would like me to tell you about my life, I can do that. It's a little long and boring, but would you like to listen?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Listen"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Don't Listen"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "As long as I can remember, my father has been making dyes. He used to spend countless hours making dyes of different colors. Even when my mother passed away, he never stopped."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "At one point in my life, I became rebellious and ran away from home. I didn't want to be stuck to the family business and wanted to try other things."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Anyways..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "I eventually wound up back home to carry on the family tradition, making dyes for 15 years already. I guess it was really in my blood."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Something I realized these days is that now I can understand my father. Why my father devoted everything to making dyes..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "In the middle of all that tedious and hard work, he probably felt the magic of those colors passing on so many dreams for other people."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "It was probably for those dreams that he tried so hard to make dyes for his customers..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Heh... How do I know this? Well, that's the way I feel right now. Since a couple years ago, I've been able to hear what the colors were saying..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullian]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Just watch. Someday, I'm going to succeed in making the color my father wanted to, but never got the chance to make."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Ahahahaha..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Well, I guess no one would want to listen to a measly dyemaker's story anyway. Hahaha...."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Great! If you want it, I'll make it for you. I promise I'll make you the color you want. But what color dye would you like to make? The fee is different depending on the color."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Why, do you ask? Just remember that there are colors that are easy to make, and those that require more effort and work. Please don't think the fee is too expensive."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "[Dye Maker Java Dullihan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "The color of the dye is special, made with all my heart and soul."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Scarlet Dyestuffs"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Lemon Dyestuffs"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Cobaltblue Dyestuffs"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Darkgreen Dyestuffs"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Orange Dyestuffs"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "Violet Dyestuffs"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Java Dullihan",
      "text" : "White Dyestuffs"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
